<body class="marketing-page">
	<SiteNav />

	<main>

	<section class="hero alt-hero">
		<div class="hero-badge">Alternatives · Transactional Email</div>
		<h1>The Postmark alternative<br/><span>you actually own.</span></h1>
		<p class="alt-lead">
			Postmark keeps your transactional sending on its platform and meters it by
			volume. Vectis Mail gives you the same transactional API and inbound webhooks
			— self-hosted on <em>your</em> infrastructure, at a flat $0–59/month no matter
			how much you send, with IMAP/POP3 mailboxes included in the same product.
		</p>
		<div class="hero-buttons" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
			<a href="/getting-started/installation/" class="btn-primary">Install Vectis Mail free</a>
			<a href="/pricing/" class="btn-secondary">View pricing</a>
		</div>
		<div class="alt-meta" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
			<span>Last updated <time datetime={dateModified}>7 July 2026</time></span>
			<span>·</span>
			<span>By the Vectis Mail team</span>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section" style="padding-top: 2rem;">
		<h2>The cost math</h2>
		<p class="subtitle">Postmark prices per email past the base bucket. Vectis Mail prices per tenant. Flat cost wins as volume climbs.</p>
		<div class="compare-table-wrap">
			<table class="compare-table">
				<thead>
					<tr><th>Monthly volume</th><th>Vectis Mail (Pro + $20/mo VPS)</th><th>Postmark</th></tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<tr><th scope="row">100 emails</th><td><strong>$0 (Starter, no VPS needed for tiny volume)</strong></td><td>$0 (Free tier, never expires)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">10,000 emails</th><td><strong>$59/mo flat</strong></td><td>$15–18/mo (Basic / Pro / Platform)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">50,000 emails</th><td><strong>$59/mo flat</strong></td><td>~$70/mo (Pro + 40K overage at $1.30/1000)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">100,000 emails</th><td><strong>$59/mo flat</strong></td><td>~$134/mo (Pro + 90K overage)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">500,000 emails</th><td><strong>$59/mo flat</strong></td><td>~$654/mo (Pro + 490K overage)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">1,000,000 emails</th><td><strong>$59/mo flat</strong></td><td>~$1,200/mo (Platform + overage at $1.20/1000)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">5,000,000+ emails</th><td><strong>$59/mo</strong> (may need larger VPS at this scale)</td><td>~$6,000/mo + DMARC/dedicated-IP add-ons</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
		<p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); margin-top: 0.5rem;">
			Postmark pricing per Postmark's published pricing, retrieved 2026-05-13. Vectis Mail assumes a $20/mo VPS + Pro tier; Starter ($0) works for up to 3 domains and 25 mailboxes per domain. Costs at high volume may need a larger VPS; the Pro tier itself stays flat.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="section" style="padding-top: 1rem;">
		<h2>At a glance</h2>
		<p class="subtitle">Side-by-side, current as of July 2026.</p>
		<div class="compare-table-wrap">
			<table class="compare-table">
				<thead>
					<tr><th></th><th>Vectis Mail</th><th>Postmark</th></tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<tr><th scope="row">Hosting model</th><td><strong>Self-hosted</strong> (your VPS, your IPs)</td><td>Managed SaaS (US-primary)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Pricing model</th><td><strong>Flat per-tenant</strong> ($39 USD/tenant/mo Pro, unlimited installs)</td><td>Per-email after the 10K base bucket</td></tr>
